	(text "5V for Teensy VIN from VMOT via U6 (R-78E5.0-0.5 buck, 7-28 V in, 500 mA).\nCut the VIN/VUSB pad jumper on the Teensy so USB and U6 don't back-feed each other."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "13056b3c-6400-4b8f-bb35-3ddddcdedc87")
	)
	(text "Current sense: each INA219 sits high-side between VMOT and its TB6612 VM pin\nU1 -> U4 (VM_DRV1), U3 -> U5 (VM_DRV2). Shared I2C on Teensy 18/19 (Wire).\nSet different I2C addresses: U1 = 0x40 (default), U3 = 0x41 (bridge A0 jumper).\n0.1R onboard shunt -> +/-3.2 A full scale per driver."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.034 66.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a16b87c9-d6e5-43f5-8a1c-292c908a8d76")
	)
	(text "J1 pin 1 = 12V in (VMOT). RPI_TX -> Teensy RX1 (pin 0), RPI_RX <- Teensy TX1 (pin 1).\nRPI_1 = Teensy 30, RPI_2 = 33, RPI_3 = 32, RPI_4 = 31. 3.3 V logic on both sides, no level shifting."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 74.422 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c550c497-496d-4e71-97cb-2f83a3f85eb7")
	)
